              "section_type": "Item_5"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "November 2023\n\n23,692,642$104.5521,626,648$19.7\n\nDecember 2023\n\n22,318,029$101.0621,319,070$17.5\n\nTotal46,010,671$102.8642,945,718",
