          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_5"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "In its 2022 Corporate Plan Update released December 8, 2022, the Corporation stated that the company expanded its share repurchase program to up to $50 billion through 2024. This includes $15 billion of repurchases in 2022 and $17.5 billion in 2023.",
            "entity_name": "XOM $50B Share Repurchase Program through 2024",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_5",
              "update_type": "revision_up"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "In its 2023 Corporate Plan Update released December 6, 2023, the Corporation stated that after the Pioneer transaction closes, the go-forward share repurchase program pace is expected to increase to $20 billion annually through 2025, assuming reasonable market conditions.",
            "entity_name": "XOM Post-Pioneer Annual Buyback Pace Guidance ($20B through 2025)",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_5"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "As required by securities law restrictions, no repurchases will take place during proxy solicitation and voting periods for transactions involving the issuance of ExxonMobil shares. For the Pioneer transaction, this period occurred during the first quarter of 2024.",
            "entity_name": "XOM Acquisition of Pioneer Natural Resources",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
